@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET / -> 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET danh sách bài tập -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tạo lượt nộp hợp lệ -> 201 + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200587",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Thanhtu278/EduSubmit-DTC245200587"
}

### 4. Đọc lại lượt nộp (bấm nhiều lần để thấy received -> processing -> graded) -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thiếu dữ liệu -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "not-a-valid-url"
}

### 6. POST bài 99 (không tồn tại) -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200587",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Thanhtu278/EduSubmit-DTC245200587"
}

### 7. GET id rỗng / không tồn tại -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bắt tay SignalR (negotiate) -> 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai đường dẫn hub -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
```

---

### 2. Cách chạy kiểm tra 9 ca
1. **Đảm bảo máy chủ đang chạy** ở cổng `5000`:
   ```powershell
   dotnet run --project src/Submission.RealtimeApi --urls http://localhost:5000